  "contracts": {
    "identities": "old id=eN retained; source_id is source user/generated edge identity. Cartesian links apply user ID only to last-start/first-end; duplicate user IDs fall back to generated source ID; source duplicate pair counters are 0,2,3,... .",
    "classesStyles": "Source declaration encounter order retained. class assignments affect existing nodes/first matching edge/groups only. ClassDefinition style/text_style append semantics and escaped comma conversion are preserved. styles remain declarative pure strings, with no execution.",
    "metadata": "Safe JSON-schema YAML, zero-indent flow continuations supported. Metadata doc.label retains source DB markup/canonical entities; unlike classic textObj it bypasses parser sanitizer. Native shared provider obligatorily sanitizes raw_label before measurement/paint. Unknown metadata provenance remains pure frozen values.",
    "collapse": "FlowDB static projection hides descendants of outermost collapsed group, converts visible collapsed group to FlowNode(shape=collapsedGroup,color_index=original source preorder slot), rewrites boundary edge endpoints and drops only collapse-induced self-loops; stable logical/source edge IDs survive projection. Visible groups retain only actual node/group member IDs, matching getData rather than raw DB edge-metadata pseudo-members.",
    "config": "Seven registered ELK names, thirteen public options, nine defaults and four unspecified strategy keys. Original finite handDrawnSeed number is preserved until roughjs-compatible truthiness/Math.imul at draw time; no eager int32 normalization.",
    "staticInteraction": "All click grammar shapes are recognized safely, and URL/callback/tooltip execution/activation/metadata are ignored. Only source clickable class is retained for initial CSS. animate/animation fields and class style declarations are pure data; root painter consumes initial dash/marker state, no player/event host.",
    "purity": "No production Node/JS/DOM/browser invocation; runtime has no .local/source checkout dependency. Parsing/config remain request-local pure values. Native assets and seeded rough paths belong to C/geometry owners.",
    "hostSettings": "flowchart.useMaxWidth is a source SVG responsive-host attribute; flowchart.useWidth is not consumed by pinned flowRenderer-v3. arrowMarkerAbsolute is a host reference concern. Values remain in config_layers; no invented Canvas geometry option.",
    "groupAlgorithmPolicy": "For an actual group, algorithm must be a string equal to elk or starting elk.; otherwise UNSUPPORTED_CONFIG before any Canvas entry. Unknown elk.* stays raw for the source resolver to ignore; no optional algorithm list expansion."
  },
